2016-09-16 14:53:21',0,NULL),(602,'So Hip it Hurts','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(230, 223, 204);\">So Hip It Hurts is downtown Toronto\'s oldest and best skate and snowboard shop, specializing in those hard to find items.&nbsp; Far removed from the big chain Walmart of skate shops, and the generic slat walled, cookie cutter shops that are here today and gone tomorrow, So Hip stands in a class all its own.&nbsp; This is very apparent from the moment you walk in.&nbsp;&nbsp; Aside from our vast selection of shoes, apparel, and row upon row of boards, we have a multitude of eye candy that adorns our walls.&nbsp; Things like original Tony Hawk decks, vintage skateboards with clay wheels, to first release Burton snowboards from the 70\'s.&nbsp; Or our \"wall of fame\" signed by celebrity So Hip shoppers such as Robin Williams, Wayne Gretzky, Jack Johnson and Adam Sandler just to name a few.</span>','<p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Shop Hours</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Jan- Mid MARCH</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Mon-Sat 11:00 to 7:00 pm</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Sunday 12:00 to 6:00 pm</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">March Break -DECEMBER &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Mon-Sat 11:00 to 8:00 pm</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">Sunday 12:00 to 7:00 pm</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">* OPEN UNTIL 9:00PM THE LAST</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(230, 224, 205);\">&nbsp;2 WEEKS&nbsp; BEFORE CHRISTMAS</p>',NULL,612,102,'http://sohipithurts.ca/about_us','https://www.facebook.com/SO-HIP-IT-HURTS-6001584354/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'+1(416) 971-6901','2000','sohip@ica.net ',1,'2016-10-02 21:13:51',0,NULL),(603,'Hammer Skateboard','<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#FF0000\" size=\"5\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">Whether you\'re a first-time beginner or a seasoned veteran,</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\"><strong><font face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">we have the gear you need.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\"><strong><font face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">- Our staff has decades of experience.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\"><strong><font face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">- We cater to all ages, levels &amp; styles of skateboarding.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"5\"><strong><font face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">- Full service &amp; tune-ups done in-store, usually while you wait.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font size=\"5\" face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">- Cash, Debit, Visa, Mastercard, Amex, JCB accepted in store.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font size=\"5\" face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\">- Visa, Mastercard, Amex &amp; PayPal accepted online.</font></strong></font></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><font color=\"#FF0000\" size=\"5\" face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\"><strong>Independently-owned.</strong></font><font color=\"#FF0000\" size=\"5\" face=\"Courier New, Courier, mono\"><strong>&nbsp;Established 2004.</strong></font></p>','dimanche12:00–17:00lundiFermémardi12:00–18:00mercredi12:00–18:00jeudi12:00–20:00vendredi12:00–18:00samedi11:00–18:00',NULL,613,102,'http://www.hammertoronto.com/index.htm','https://www.facebook.com/Hammer-Skateboard-147901745251710/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'+1416-698-0005','2000','info@hammertoronto.com',1,'2016-10-02 21:20:24',0,NULL),(604,'Blue Tile Lounge','<span style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Blue Tile Lounge will do their very best to ensure that our online store does not have any problems and that goods displayed are always available. However it cannot be guaranteed that the online store or that any goods on the site are in stock or available. In the event that your ordered items are out of stock we will notify you as soon as we can.</span>','<span style=\"font-weight: 700; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">HOURS:</span><br style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Monday - Friday: 12pm to 8pm</span><br style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Saturday: 12pm to 7pm</span><br style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(78, 73, 73); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Sunday: 12pm to 5pm</span>',NULL,614,102,'http://bluetilelounge.ca/','https://www.facebook.com/bluetileloungeskateboardshop',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'+1416-792-7171','2000','N/A',1,'2016-10-02 21:24:37',0,NULL),(605,'Longboard Living','<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(181, 181, 181); margin-top: 10px; font-family: proxima-nova, sans-serif;\">Longboard Living is a store front and online shop for all level riders. We offer specialized service and sales to thousands of boarders since 2008 in the Toronto market and now in the Niagara Region. &nbsp;</p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(181, 181, 181); margin-top: 10px; font-family: proxima-nova, sans-serif;\">Our retail atmosphere is crisp, cool and full of choice brand products to choose from while our online shop has an extended list of top gear. We look forward to helping you find your next board and remind you to always skate safe.</p>','<div><br></div><div><table class=\"_Y0c\" style=\"margin-top: 3px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><tbody><tr class=\"_NEd\" style=\"color: black; font-weight: bold;\"><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">dimanche</td><td>12:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">lundi</td><td>12:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">mardi</td><td>12:00–19:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">mercredi</td><td>12:00–19:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">jeudi</td><td>12:00–19:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">vendredi</td><td>12:00–19:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">samedi</td><td>12:00–19:00</td></tr></tbody></table></div>',NULL,615,102,'http://www.longboardliving.com/','https://www.facebook.com/LongboardLiving202',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'+1(416) 901-7787','2000','info@longboardliving.com',1,'2016-10-02 21:29:55',0,NULL),(606,'Longboard Haven','<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85098);\">&nbsp;Longboard Haven is a name with deep roots in Toronto longboarding. The shop\'s first incarnation in 2006, as an underground operation, was run from the basement apartment of Patrick \"P-Swiss\" Switzer. Patrick has since become a top international downhill skateboarder, but it was he in conjunction with Mike \"Smooth Chicken\" McGown, and Adam \"Joker\" Winston, who made the original shop a reality. The Haven\'s namesake is a previously little known garage that core members of the Toronto skate community frequented for many years.</span>','Mon:ClosedTue