e: nowrap;\">Mardi :&nbsp;</span>06:00 - 20:00</p><p>Mercredi : 07:00 - 21:00</p><p>Jeudi : 06:00 - 21:00</p><p>Vendredi : 06:00 - 19:00</p><p>Samedi : 09:00 - 12:00</p><p>Dimanche : 09:00 - 12:00</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,677,107,'http://www.lusine.ca/lusine-taschereau/','https://www.facebook.com/lusinetaschereau',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'514.772.5564','Inconnu ','marc-andre@lusine.ca',1,'2017-01-03 20:51:39',0,NULL),(667,'L\'usine Crossfit Repentigny','','<p>Lundi : 07:00 - 20:00</p><p>Mardi : 10:00 - 20:00</p><p>Mercredi : 07:00 - 20:00</p><p>Jeudi : 10:00 - 20:00</p><p>Vendredi : 07:00 - 20:00</p><p>Samedi : 10:00 - 12:00</p><p>Dimanche : 10:00 - 12:00</p>',NULL,678,107,'http://www.lusine.ca/lusine-repentigny/','https://www.facebook.com/LUsineCrossfitRepentigny/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'514-927-1141','Inconnu','info@lusinerepentigny.ca',1,'2017-01-03 20:59:03',0,NULL),(668,'Milk Run MX','<ul style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 16px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; vertical-align: baseline; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: transparent; vertical-align: baseline;\">In case you are all wondering.....The Milk Run is mainly snowboard terminology, meaning the first run of the day.<br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Getting up at the crack of dawn, usually still aching from the day before, whilst trying to be the first out on the fresh untouched white powder, is what it’s all about.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">We accept this term can be used for anyone that feels passionate about their sport and wants to get out there before the crowds and enjoy that glorious first run, be it descending down a new track on a mountain bike, gliding along that new tarmac road at the crack of dawn or skipping across the freshly formed whoops on your dirt bike.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">The Milk Run is all about a passion for action sports and adventures</span><br></li></ul>','<table style=\"width: 509px; margin: 0px 0px 15px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 6px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: transparent; vertical-align: baseline;\">British summer time:</strong><br>Wednesdays 10:00 – 15:00<br>Wed&nbsp;evenings 16:00 – 19:00<br>Saturdays&nbsp;10:00 – 16:00<br>Sundays&nbsp;10:00 – 16:00</td><td style=\"padding: 6px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: transparent; vertical-align: baseline;\">British winter time:</strong><br>Wednesdays 10:00 – 15:00<br>Wed&nbsp;evenings N/A<br>Saturdays&nbsp;10:00 – 15:30<br>Sundays&nbsp;10:00 – 15:30<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; background: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></td></tr></tbody></table>',NULL,679,4,'http://themilkrun.net/','https://www.facebook.com/themilkrun2012/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+447881 301731','2000','info@themilkrun.net',1,'2017-01-04 08:36:56',0,NULL),(669,'Mill Lane Motocross Track',' ',' ',NULL,680,4,'N/A','https://www.facebook.com/Mill-Lane-Motocross-Track-264113280603604/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'N/A','2000','N/A',1,'2017-01-04 08:54:41',0,NULL),(670,'Golding Barn Raceway Circuit','<span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Professionally run Moto-cross practice circuit. Open practice every Wednesday plus the first Sunday of each month (track conditions permitting). Track flag marshals, Medic, Cafe, Toilets and great track viewing. A great facility for all abilities.</span>',' ',NULL,681,4,'http://www.goldingbarnraceway.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/Golding-Barn-Raceway-Circuit-172915312749861/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 1903 816758','2000','dan@goldingbarnraceway.co.uk',1,'2017-01-04 09:01:01',0,NULL),(671,'Arncott Moto Park',' ',' ',NULL,682,4,'http://arncottmotopark.com/','https://www.facebook.com/ArncottMotoPark/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 117 325 1977','2000','N/A',1,'2017-01-04 09:25:08',0,NULL),(672,'WildTracks Activity Park ',' ',' ',NULL,683,4,'http://www.wildtracksltd.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/wildtracks/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 1638 751918','2000','enquiries@wildtracksltd.co.uk',1,'2017-01-05 09:26:58',0,NULL),(673,'Mildenhall MX Ltd','<span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Motoland UK offers a Technical and Challenging Track suitable for all levels of rider.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">We operate grouped sessions for children and adults.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Motoland UK has full</span><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;amenities, such as toilets, showers canteen and jet wash facilities.<br><br>We also offer training days provided by Chris Bastick - visit&nbsp;<span class=\"fwb\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"http://www.train-2-gain.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color: rgb(54, 88, 153); cursor: pointer;\">www.train-2-gain.co.uk</a></span>&nbsp;for more information</span>',' ',NULL,684,4,'www.train-2-gain.co.uk ','https://www.facebook.com/Mildenhall-MX-Ltd-115949438478387/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441638 718 667','2000','moto_land_uk@hotmail.co.uk',1,'2017-01-05 09:56:28',0,NULL),(674,'F-15 MX Track','<span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">The Mepal Track is 8 miles from the City Of Ely, Cambs and The MK track is situated off Tongwell Street in the Pineham area of Milton Keynes. Via the M1 take the exit at Junction 14 towards Pineham and Milton Keynes and turn right at the first roundabout onto the A509. At the next roundabout turn right on to Tongwell Street. Our entrance road is about 400m on the left and leads under Tongwell Street up to the track which is located by the motorway.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br>',' ',NULL,685,4,'http://www.f-15mx.com/','https://www.facebook.com/F15MXTrack/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 7887 604981','2000','info@f-15mx.com',1,'2017-01-05 10:01:05',0,NULL),(675,'Cusses Gorse MX','<div class=\"_4bl9\" style=\"word-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; flex: 1 0 0px; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><div class=\"_3-8w\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">Cusses Gorse MX is a motocross facility based in the south of England near Salisbury Wiltshire.</div><div><br></div></div>',' ',NULL,686,4,'http://www.cussesgorse.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/Cusses-Gorse-MX-1763946937155783/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 1980 863900','2000','ianbarclay109@hotmail.co.uk',1,'2017-01-05 10:07:26',0,NULL),(676,'Action Watersports','<p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: verdana;\">Action Watersports is a&nbsp;<strong>family run</strong>&nbsp;Watersports centre, all the staff are&nbsp;<strong>passionate</strong>&nbsp;about the&nbsp;<strong>exhilarating</strong>&nbsp;<strong>activities</strong>&nbsp;we provide.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: verdana;\">As a British Water-ski Accredited Water-ski School and RYA Centre, Action Watersports specialises in offering Water-Skiing, Wakeboarding, Jet Skiing, Stand-up Paddle Boards (SUP), Fun Rides and FlyBoarding in a&nbsp;<strong>safe</strong>, controlled but&nbsp;<strong>fun</strong>&nbsp;<strong>environment</strong>, on a private freshwater lake.&nbsp;We&nbsp;<strong>love</strong>&nbsp;sharing our passion and knowledge with our guests.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"rtejustify\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); text-align: justify; font-family: verdana;\">Action Watersports was founded in 2001 by water-ski competitors&nbsp;<strong>Simon</strong>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<strong>Di</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Raine</strong>.</p><p class=\"rtejustify\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); text-align: justify; font-family: verdana;\">They were lucky to realise every watersports enthusiasts’ dream of owning their own lake. The lake they found was the perfect size for a world class water-ski facility. They set about carrying out large scale landscaping and tree planting transforming this barren hole in the ground into a&nbsp;<strong>friendly</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>welcoming</strong>&nbsp;<strong>place</strong>&nbsp;to enjoy a host of Watersport activities. . Now 17 years on the fully established plants and trees offer&nbsp;<strong>superb</strong>&nbsp;protection from the elements on this&nbsp;<strong>backwash</strong>&nbsp;<strong>free</strong>&nbsp;lake with an added slalom course.</p><p class=\"rtejustify\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); text-align: justify; font-family: verdana;\">Action Watersports is a Royal Yachting Association recognised teaching establishment and British Water Ski &amp; Wakeboard Accredited School.</p><p class=\"rtejustify\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); text-align: justify; font-family: verdana;\">Beginners can have&nbsp;<strong>fun</strong>&nbsp;with our&nbsp;<strong>friendly</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>structured courses</strong>. For the more experienced slalom, wakeboard and barefoot water skiers we offer the latest&nbsp;<strong>advanced</strong>&nbsp;<strong>coaching</strong>&nbsp;techniques.</p><p class=\"rtejustify\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); text-align: justify; font-family: verdana;\">From taking a flight above the lake on the flyboard to enjoying a&nbsp;<strong>hilarious</strong>&nbsp;fun ride, we supply everything for an&nbsp;<strong>adrenalin</strong>&nbsp;pumped, fun packed,&nbsp;<strong>thrilling</strong>&nbsp;visit.</p>','<p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: verdana;\">As a family run business our opening times are flexible.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: verdana;\">We are open 7 days a week in high season.</p>',NULL,687,4,'http://www.actionwatersports.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/actionwatersports?fref=ts',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441797 321885','2000','simon@actionwatersports.co.uk',1,'2017-01-07 08:54:35',0,NULL),(677,'Blackpool Wake Park','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">Blackpool Wake Park is set in one of the most tranquil spots in the UK and has 2 System 2.0’s and obstacles to test the best of riders, there is an onsite cafe and a south facing patio overlooking all the action, when the sun isn’t shining there is plenty of seating inside and chill shelters for the riders at the edge of the lake.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">Our 10 acre lake is set in the beautiful Fylde countryside and was created from a natural spring discovered on the farm land.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">We are open to the public throughout the year and offer a wide variety of activities&nbsp; wakeboarding, Stand up paddle boarding, Kayaking and open water swimming.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">All our instructors are fully qualified with the British Waterski Federation and all staff are trained First Aiders.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><br></p>','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">Sat&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9.00 am &nbsp; –&nbsp;&nbsp; 6.00 pm</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Rambla, arial, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">Sun&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9.00 am &nbsp; –&nbsp;&nbsp; 6.00 pm</p>',NULL,688,4,'http://www.blackpoolwakepark.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/blackpool.wakepark?ref=ts&fref=ts',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441253 836543','2000','info@blackpoolwakepark.com',1,'2017-01-07 09:00:29',0,NULL),(678,'Box End Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(107, 107, 107); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(227, 229, 231);\">Box End Park is a truly unique destination within the UK. Incorporating an amazing, giant Aqua-park, premium Water-ski and Wakeboarding facilities, a lakeside bar and restaurant and meeting and function rooms, there really is something for everyone at our 100 acre site.&nbsp;</span>','<span style=\"color: rgb(115, 123, 127); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(243, 243, 243);\">We are open 12 months of the year, however adjust our opening hours each month depending on light levels and water temperature.</span>',NULL,689,4,'http://www.boxendpark.com/','https://www.facebook.com/BoxEndPark/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441234 846222','2000','info@boxendpark.com',1,'2017-01-07 09:08:08',0,NULL),(679,'Camel Ski School','  <p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: 2rem; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Raleway, HelveticaNeue, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><br style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; letter-spacing: 0px;\"></strong></p><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: 2rem; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Raleway, HelveticaNeue, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">The Camel Ski School is run and owned by myself Charlie. Ive been doing this for 15 years and love it!</p><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: 2rem; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Raleway, HelveticaNeue, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Our core business is Waterskiing/Wakeboarding, Inflatable Rides and Boat Driving Courses however we also offer Paddle Boarding, Kayaking, as well as selling our new range of Ski School stash and Jobe equipment in our updated Pro Shop.</span><span style=\"font-size: 2rem;\">Come on down and say hi! We have delicious Italian coffee flowing all day?.</span></p> ',' ','',770,4,'http://camelskischool.com/','https://www.facebook.com/Camel-Ski-School-Rock-Water-Sports-202862473108016/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441208 862727','2000','charlie@camelskischool.com',1,'2017-01-07 09:14:39',0,NULL),(680,'Chichester Watersports','<span style=\"font-family: Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\">Chichester Watersports is on the A27 just 5 minutes from Chichester town centre. Our lake, measuring around 40 acres was once a gravel pit.</span><br style=\"font-family: Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\">The South Downs is the main supply of our freshwater lake which has become the centre for waterbased activies such as wakeboarding, paddleboarding, waterskiing, monoskiing, wakeskating, wakesurfing and knee-boarding on the South Coast.</span>','',NULL,691,4,'http://www.chichesterwatersports.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/ChichesterWatersports',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441243 776439','2000','info@chichesterwatersports.com',1,'2017-01-07 09:26:00',0,NULL),(681,'Exe Wake','<p style=\"padding: 0.5em 0px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Exe Wake is a close knit team of professional, hard-working and fun individuals. We share a love of just about all watersports and this shines through in the enthusiasm and enjoyment we get from our work. Mark Beasley leads the team and helps ensure that the highest standards of service and safety are delivered at all times.</p><p style=\"padding: 0.5em 0px; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Exe Wake is a registered member of the British Water Ski body ensuring we meet the highest standards and offer the best levels of tuition</p>','<span style=\"font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;\">If we are on the water and unable to answer your call, please leave us a message and a member of the team will return your call as soon as possible.</span>',NULL,692,4,'http://www.exewake.co.uk/','N/A',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+447825 539 450','2000','info@exewake.com',1,'2017-01-07 09:34:44',0,NULL),(682,'Festival Wakeboard Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(196, 32, 32);\">Festival Wakeboard Park is a state of the art wakeboarding complex situated behind Festival Leisure Park, Basildon. We cater for all abilities from complete beginners through to world champions. Along with our 660m main cable, we also have a 175m System 2.0 trainer cable which is perfect for beginners and people wanting to improve their skills. Our qualified coaches can teach you everything from getting up on the board, hitting our kickers and rails to your first big air tricks.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; text-align: center;\">Aqua Park! And now refresh in the Cafe after while relaxing on our NEW beach.</span>','',NULL,693,4,'http://www.festwake.com/','https://www.facebook.com/Festival.Wakeboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44844 8879253','2000','info@festwake.com ',1,'2017-01-07 09:39:19',0,NULL),(683,'Foxlake Adventures','<span style=\"font-family: montserrat; font-size: 20px; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Cable wakeboarding is the world’s fastest growing watersport, using an overhead cable which pulls you over the surface of the lake with a feel similar to surfing or snowboarding but on water. Wakeboarding is one of the most progressive extreme sports and we guarantee if you don’t get up in your first session, you get your money back! Whether you’re an experienced rider or a complete beginner, the Foxlake team will be able to help!</span>',' ',NULL,771,4,'http://www.foxlake.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/foxlakeadventures',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441620 860 657 ','2000','info@foxlake.co.uk',1,'2017-01-07 09:50:02',0,NULL),(684,'Glasgow Wake Park','<p style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: Cabin, sans-serif; font-size: medium; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 18px; float: left; width: 582.219px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(26, 21, 16);\">Glasgow Wake Park is a System 2.0 wakeboard park based in the City Centre at the Port Dundas Canal. We operate out of the Pinkston Paddle Centre and share all of their first class facilities.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: Cabin, sans-serif; font-size: medium; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 18px; float: left; width: 582.219px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(26, 21, 16);\">Wakeboarding is one of the fastest growing watersports. It is very similar to snowboarding or skateboarding on water and has become the cool and youthful alternative to water-skiing. The cable system allows the wakeboarder to ride continuously by turning at each end of the basin. We have 4 obstacles floating in the water that allow the rider to perform varying levels of tricks.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: Cabin, sans-serif; font-size: medium; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 18px; float: left; width: 582.219px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(26, 21, 16);\">It is a very easy sport to learn on the cable and riders can progress amazingly quickly. We aim to have 100% success rate with our beginners and our qualified coaches will do everything it takes to get you out the water and riding.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: Cabin, sans-serif; font-size: medium; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 18px; float: left; width: 582.219px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(26, 21, 16);\">This is definitely an awesome way to make use of the Clyde &amp; Forth Canal so come along and carve up the canal</p>',' ',NULL,695,4,'http://www.glasgowwakepark.com/','https://www.facebook.com/GlasgowWakePark',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 7415 787260','2000','ride@glasgowwakepark.com',1,'2017-01-07 19:07:38',0,NULL),(685,'Gosfield Lake Water Ski Club','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Gosfield Lake Resort is a private family run leisure park, set in the heart of rural Essex, close to Constable Country and right on the Essex Way. The 36 acre lake and surrounding countryside combine to create a natural beauty spot, where clear summer evenings give way to spectacular sunsets. Enjoy the thrill of water skiing with Gosfield Lake Water Ski Club. The natural sheltering provides perfect skiing conditions and this featured together with a full international slalom course and jump make the facilities ideal for the serious skier or the complete novice. Only the best equipment is used and we have two boats both of which are of full tournament specification. Top class National Champion Coaches are on hand to assist at all times.</span>',' ',NULL,696,4,'http://www.gosfieldlake.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/gosfieldlake/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441787 475043','2000','turps@gosfieldlake.co.uk',1,'2017-01-07 19:10:54',0,NULL),(686,'Hannam\'s Wake Hub','<span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: center;\">Welcome to Hannams Wake Hub, the best place to try wakeboarding in Cambridgeshire. We are a BWSW accredited facility situated in a unique location within farmland in the fens, with 3 straight line cables and a great range of UNIT obstacles you will find an inspiring cable facility that will help you to progress your ability on a wakeboard or wakeskate, whether you are trying it for the first time, or are a well seasoned rider.&nbsp;</span>',' ',NULL,697,4,'http://www.hannamswakehub.com/','https://www.facebook.com/HWHwakepark/?fref=ts',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44(0)1353 649 683','2000','INFO@HANNAMSWAKEHUB.COM',1,'2017-01-07 19:14:17',0,NULL),(687,'JB Ski','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">John Battleday Water Ski is a beautiful 120 acre water ski and wakeboard venue near London. We cater for all ability levels from beginners to advanced offering water skiing and wakeboarding, full cable, system 2.0, cafe and beach facilities. Our aim is to provide these facilities with safety paramount to our operation. We pride ourselves on our friendly and fun atmosphere where members, non-members, families, educational and corporate groups can enjoy a great sport in a fantastic location with professional staff.</span>',' ',NULL,698,4,'http://www.jbski.com/','https://www.facebook.com/JBWaterskiWakeboard/?hc_ref=SEARCH&fref=nf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441932 579750','2000','info@jbwaterski.com',1,'2017-01-07 19:20:28',0,NULL),(688,'Just Wake','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Offering facilities for all levels of wakeboarders, from complete beginners to the seasoned pro. 2 x System 2.0 Cable Park with 10 Obstacles. Boat Ski School SBD Centre Aquapark Paddleboarding &amp; Kayaking</span>',' ',NULL,699,4,'http://www.justwake.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/Justwake/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+447812 712255 ','2000','ENQUIRIES@JUSTWAKE.CO.UK ',1,'2017-01-07 19:23:53',0,NULL),(689,'Lagoon Wake Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">We have two RYA training centres in Brighton</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Hove Lagoon is one of the best locations on the south coast for learning and practicing watersports. We offer cable wakeboarding, windsurfing, Standup Paddleboarding, sailing, kayaking for adults, kids and groups. Hove lagoon is perfect venue being shallow, sheltered, right by the sea and close to the town. All activities suitable for complete beginners and include full tuition and all equipment hire.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Our Brighton Marina centre is home to bigger ocean going craft and we offer yacht sailing, coastal boat sailing and powerboating from here.</span>',' ',NULL,700,4,'www.lagoon.co.uk','https://www.facebook.com/LagoonWatersports',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44 1273 424842','2000','info@lagoonwatersports.co.uk',1,'2017-01-10 10:35:05',0,NULL),(690,'Lakeside Ski and Wake','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Lakeside Ski and Wake is based in the idyllic Cotswold Water Park. It boasts a beautiful naturally sheltered spring fed lake. We run only the latest Ski Nautique boat, have a sports bar &amp; restaurant, gymnasium and sauna. We pride ourselves on being one of the finest watersports centres in Europe and provide a friendly and safe environment.</span>',' ',NULL,701,4,'www.lakeside-bar.co.uk ','https://www.facebook.com/lakesideskiandwake',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441285 860606','2000','lakeside-bar@tiscali.co.uk',1,'2017-01-10 10:39:07',0,NULL),(691,'Lakeview Wake Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Cable Wakeboarding has allowed the sport to become much more accessible. With only one person riding at any one time our coaches can focus on progressing your riding skills from beginner to advanced. With a range of features from Shape Obstacles you\'re sure to have fun. We are using the latest in straight line towing technology to ensure for the ultimate and safest riding experience. The rydium system is designed and manufactured in the UK and caters for beginners through to the world\'s elite riders.</span>',' ',NULL,772,4,'www.lakeviewwakepark.com ','https://www.facebook.com/lakeviewwakepark/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+337895 325724','2000','lakeviewwakepark@gmail.com',1,'2017-01-10 10:43:33',0,NULL),(692,'Liquid Leisure Water Ski and Wakeboard',' ',' ',NULL,703,4,'www.llski.com ','https://www.facebook.com/LiquidWakePark/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+44(0)1753 542 500','2000','info@liquidleisure.com',1,'2017-01-10 10:48:23',0,NULL),(693,'Liverpool Wake Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Liverpool Wake Park is situated in the famous Liverpool Docks. We have two System 2.0 cables and a host of obstacles. We run kid\'s clubs, ladies only sessions, we are also an amazing venue for stag and hen parties and love teaching anyone from beginners to the British Team. Our youngest rider is 6 years old and our oldest is over 70! Our qualified BWSW instructors and coaches will work with you to keep you learning new trick after new trick and rapidly moving up the progression ladder. We love passing on our knowledge and we get just as much of a buzz teaching our riders as we do riding ourselves. Our aim is to have the most fun you can on the water! We are based at Liverpool Watersports Centre which also offers a number of other water activities.</span>',' ',NULL,704,4,'http://liverpoolwakepark.co.uk/','https://www.facebook.com/liverpoolwakepark',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+441512308247','2000','ride@liverpoolwakepark.co.uk',1,'2017-01-10 14:11:59',0,NULL),(694,'Loch Lomond Wakeboard','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Loch Lomond Wakeboard provide a relaxed environment for people of all ages and abilities to enjoy wakeboarding, waterskiing, wakeskating, wakesurfing, boat trips, inflatables and more.Based on the shores of Loch Lomond and within easy reach of Glasgow, we offer professional wakeboarding lessons from the UK\'s top 10 coaches for boarders and skaters of all ages.Lesson packages range from individual lessons to week long camps in luxury Loch-side accommodation. We can tailor an individual package to suit your needs.We run three Nautique boats including a brand new 210 super air which provides a pro-sized wake.</span>',' ',NULL,705,4,'http://www.lochlomondwakeboard.com/','https://www.facebook.com/LLWakeboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+447545561360','2000','Ride@lochlomondwakeboard.com',1,'2017-01-10 14:16:35',0,NULL),(695,'North Devon Wake Park','<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helveticaneue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Devon\'s first cable wake park!! For those of you who don\'t know Wakeboarding is similar to skateboarding and snowboarding, accept for that your feet are strapped in and it is on water. You hold a handle attached to an overhead cable that pulls you along the water; this cable is manually controlled by a cable operator and run by electricity- no boat is involved. As you improve you are able to progress over the park obstacles which float under the cable; we have eight obstacles that vary in ability to cater for everybody. We also offer wakeskating which is similar to wakeboarding but your feet are not attached to the board; and waterskiing. Kneeboarding and ringo rides will also be on offer. We are open for individual bookings and group parties for all abilities and ages. Other activities on site include an Inflatable waterpark suitable for 55 people, beach volleyball, stand up paddle boarding, slacklines, and takeaway food.</span>',' ',NULL,773,4,'http://www.northdevonwakepark.co.uk/ ','https://www.facebook.com/North-Devon-Wake-Park-287893551370466/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'+447956009047','2000','info@northdevonwakepark.co.uk',1,'2017-01-10 14:21:49',0,NULL),(696,'Crossfit Westmount','<h3 class=\"title-heading-center\" data-fontsize=\"22\" data-lineheight=\"31\" style=\"margin: 0px; flex-grow: 0; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.45; text-align: center;\"><div>Notre gym est situé à Westmount et a été bâti sur notre passion pour la santé et le conditionnement physique.</div><div>Notre équipe est dédiée à aider les gens à atteindre leurs objectifs de conditionnement et a hâte de vous souhaiter la bienvenue dans notre gym.</div></h3>','<p>Lundi : 6h00–20h00<br></p><p>Mardi : 7h00–20h00</p><p>Mercredi : 6h00–20h00</p><p>Jeudi : 7h00–19h00</p><p>Vendredi : 6h00–19h00</p><p>samedi : 9h30–13h00</p><p>Dimanche : 9h30–13h00<br></p>',NULL,707,107,'http://crossfitwestmount.com/fr/acceuil/','https://www.facebook.com/CrossFitWestmount',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'(438) 886-3217','2000','info@crossfitwestmount.com',1,'2017-01-11 03:06:51',0,NULL),(697,'Crossfit de l\'Ouest','<p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">CrossFit de L’Ouest est l’original! Nous sommes un gym d’entraînement situé au cœur de l’ouest de L’île de Montréal. Notre gym utilise la méthode du CrossFit pour améliorer l’état de santé, de force et de conditionnement de chacun, à tous les niveau de forme physique. En travaillant les mouvements fonctionnels à une haute intensité, les athlètes obtiennent des résultats et des performances inespérés.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">Nous nous basons sur une structure empirique d’un programme d’entraînement mainte fois testé. Nous combinons nos approches pour que chaque individus atteigne des amélioration tangibles toute en force, en endurance et en développement morphologique.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\">Loin d’être restreint aux athlètes d’élite, le Crossfit est applicable aux&nbsp;individus de vie active ou&nbsp;sédentaire. En vous guidant à travers notre programme, nous vous aidons à atteindre vos objectifs d’entraînement personnels, quelqu’ils soient.</p>','<div class=\"_tDe r-iJs7aFCjrSlw t_oh\" jsl=\"$t t-9RdNJJYI2N0;$x 0;\" style=\"display: inline;\"><div class=\"vk_bk a_h\" jsaction=\"oh.handleHoursAction\" tabindex=\"0\" data-ved=\"0ahUKEwibwKqejbnRAhUk04MKHezoBTwQ5nEIlgEwEw\" style=\"opacity: 1; position: static; visibility: inherit; display: inline-block; h