class=\"_54ni __MenuItem\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\"><br></li><li class=\"_54ni __MenuItem\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\">Samedi : 10:00 - 14:00</li><li class=\"_54ni __MenuItem\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\"><br></li><li class=\"_54ni __MenuItem\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"overflow: hidden;\">Dimanche : 10:00 - 14:00</li></ul>',NULL,712,107,'https://www.crossfitdelacite.com/','https://www.facebook.com/Crossfit-De-La-Cit%C3%A9-and-Crossfit-Kids-De-La-Cit%C3%A9-673195589376596/',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'(514) 296-8352','2000','info@crossfitdelacite.com',1,'2017-01-11 03:48:04',0,NULL),(702,'Crossfit Trinital','<p class=\"font_7\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">Dans notre box, nous&nbsp;proposons un programme&nbsp;de préparation physique pour vous : nous coachons les mouvements et les exercices; nous vous&nbsp;offrons des conseils&nbsp;en nutrition et récupération si vous le souhaitez; et nous vous aidons à&nbsp;progresser, développer&nbsp;vos performances et augmenter votre endurance à chaque fois que vous venez chez nous.</p><p class=\"font_7\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><br>Nous sommes convaincus que nous donnons à chaque athlète, un&nbsp;rapport qualité prix&nbsp;qui est imbattable. Tous les entrainements CrossFit sont animés par un ou plusieurs coaches certifiés pour l’utilisation des méthodes CrossFit.&nbsp;</p>','<div class=\"_G1d _wle _xle\" style=\"border-top: 1px solid rgb(235, 235, 235);\"><div class=\"_RBg\"><div class=\"mod\" data-md=\"1005\" data-ved=\"0ahUKEwiy-4XLlrnRAhVJ94MKHZfQDDMQkCkIfSgEMBA\" style=\"clear: none; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px; line-height: 1.24;\"><div class=\"_eFb\"><div class=\"kno-fb-ctx _mr t_oh\" data-dtype=\"d3oh\" style=\"margin-top: 7px;\"><div jsl=\"$t t-TzwsNicIE5w;$x 0;\" class=\"r-iPKYvosNQIHM\"><div class=\"_tDe r-iTG2x81070YI t_oh\" jsl=\"$t t-9RdNJJYI2N0;$x 0;\" style=\"display: inline;\"><div class=\"vk_bk a_h\" jsaction=\"oh.handleHoursAction\" tabindex=\"0\" data-ved=\"0ahUKEwiy-4XLlrnRAhVJ94MKHZfQDDMQ5nEIgQEwEA\" style=\"opacity: 1; position: static; visibility: inherit; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-top: -3px; overflow: hidden; transition: opacity 1s; vertical-align: top;\"><table class=\"_Y0c\" style=\"margin-top: 3px;\"><tbody><tr class=\"_NEd\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Mercredi</td><td>09:00–14:00, 17:45–21:15</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Jeudi</td><td>06:15–12:00, 17:45–21:15</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Vendredi</td><td>09:00–14:00, 17:45–20:15</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Samedi</td><td>08:45–12:15</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Dimanche</td><td>09:00–12:00</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">Lundi</td><td>09:00–14:00, 17:45–21:15</td></tr><tr><td class=\"_X0c\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">mardi</td><td>06:15–12:00, 17:45–21:15</td></tr></tbody></table><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mod\" data-md=\"140\" style=\"clear: both; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px; line-height: 1.24; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div jsl=\"$t t-i1YM35z_XsA;$x 0;\" class=\"r-i9CZHr8hiP28\"><div></div></di