;\">Jeudi :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">08:00 - 20:00</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vendredi :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">08:00 - 20:00</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Samedi : 11:00 - 19:00</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dimanche : 11:00 - 19:00</span></p><p><br></p>',NULL,901,107,'http://www.reebok.com/us/sale','https://www.facebook.com/TeamReebok22/','200_shop_855_20175123222.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'+1 407-351-9335','2000','info@reebok.com',1,'2017-05-02 03:14:38',0,NULL),(856,'District RX','<h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"color_12\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">District RX est LA référence à Québec en</span></span></h2><h2 class=\"font_2\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"color_12\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">vêtements de sports spécialisés en CrossFit</span>®<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">.</span></span></h2>','<p>Lundi :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">15:30 - 20:30</span></p><p>Mardi : FERMÉ</p><p>Mercredi :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">15:30 - 20:30</span></p><p>Jeudi :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">15:30 - 20:30</span></p><p>Vendredi: 15:30 - 20:30</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Samedi: 10:00 - 16h00</span></p><p>Dimanche: 11:00 - &nbsp;16:00</p>',NULL,902,107,'https://www.districtrx.com/','https://www.facebook.com/districtrxqc?fref=ts','200_shop_856_201752204912.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'(418) 681-2224','2015','districtrx@gmail.com',1,'2017-05-03 01:01:02',0,NULL),(857,'Deka Crossfit','<p class=\"font_7\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; backgroun