an></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Notre plus grande force; le service aux athlètes, le dévouement perpétuel auprès de ceux-ci et un affût constant face aux nouvelles tendances afin d’améliorer la performance des athlètes Crossfit.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">​</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">Maintenant en collaboration avec Jonathan Allard de Allard Fitness, la Boutique Deka Crossfit propose les meilleurs suppléments adaptés à chaque athlète selon leurs besoins en entraînement et en nutrition.</span></p>','<p style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px;\">Lundi : 08:00 - 19:00</p><p style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px;\">Mardi:&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">08:00 - 19:00</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px;\">Mercredi :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">08:00 - 19:00</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 12px;\">Jeudi :&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">08:00 - 19:00</span></p><p style=\"font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial